{"id":142,"name":"aerodactyl","speciesId":142,"dex":142,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["rock","flying"],"stats":{"hp":80,"attack":105,"defense":65,"special-attack":60,"special-defense":75,"speed":130},"abilities":[{"name":"rock-head","hidden":false},{"name":"pressure","hidden":false},{"name":"unnerve","hidden":true}],"height":18,"weight":590,"baseExp":180,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/142.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/142.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/142.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/142.ogg","genus":"Fossil Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Fósseis","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades."},{"version":"red","text":"A ferocious, pre­ historic POKéMON that goes for the enemy's throat with its serrated saw-like fangs."},{"version":"yellow","text":"A savage POKéMON that died out in ancient times. It was resurrected using DNA taken from amber."},{"version":"gold","text":"A vicious POKéMON from the distant past, it appears to have flown by spreading its wings and gliding."},{"version":"silver","text":"This vicious POKé­ MON is said to have flown in an­ cient skies while shrieking high- pitched cries."},{"version":"crystal","text":"In prehistoric times, this POKéMON flew freely and fearlessly through the skies."},{"version":"ruby","text":"AERODACTYL is a POKéMON from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from genetic material extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies in ancient times."},{"version":"emerald","text":"AERODACTYL is a POKéMON from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from DNA extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies."},{"version":"firered","text":"It was regenerated from a dinosaur’s genetic matter that was found in amber. It flies with high-pitched cries."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"A ferocious, prehistoric POKéMON that goes for the enemy’s throat with its serrated, sawlike fangs."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"A vicious Pokémon from the distant past, it appears to have flown by spreading its wings and gliding."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"This vicious Pokémon is said to have flown in ancient skies while shrieking high-pitched cries."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aerodactyl is a Pokémon from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from genetic material extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies in ancient times."},{"version":"sun","text":"A Pokémon from the age of the dinosaurs. It used its sawlike fangs to shred its prey before eating them."},{"version":"moon","text":"In ancient times, it ruled the skies. A widely accepted theory is that it went extinct due to a large meteor impact."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Restored from DNA found in amber, this Pokémon exhibited ferocity that was greater than expected. Some casualties resulted."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It flew through the open skies over the ancient continent as if they were its own. When it touched ground, its walk was weak and slow."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A savage Pokémon that died out in ancient times. It was resurrected using DNA taken from amber."},{"version":"sword","text":"This is a ferocious Pokémon from ancient times. Apparently even modern technology is incapable of producing a perfectly restored specimen."},{"version":"shield","text":"Aerodactyl’s sawlike fangs can shred skin to tatters—even the skin of Steel-type Pokémon."}],"flavorPt":"As presas em forma de serra do Aerodactyl podem despedaçar a pele, até mesmo a pele de Pokémon do tipo Aço.","genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["flying"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution"